# Florist dialogue (Ivy Bloomwell)

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.fallback=If you need the shop build, the house line, or a word about what is blooming, say it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.greeting.0=Good morning. The leaves look happy today.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.greeting.1=I brought extra seeds in my pocket. Old habit.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.greeting.2=Your town has nice light for growing things.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.greeting.3=Sorry if I smell like soil. I was repotting before I came over.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.hint.love.0=Fresh flowers or orchids would make my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.hint.love.1=Bring me something green and blooming if you want to see me smile.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=Please do not bring me trash or dead plants.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Void stuff and bones have no place in a garden.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_house=You wanted to talk about a house.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_house_done=Your name is on the house shelf. I wanted you to hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_house_remind=The house is still in progress.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_shop_done=I wanted to check in now that the flower shop is standing.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_shop_complete=The flower shop is finished. I am here to close things out with you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_shop_building=The shop is still coming together. I wanted to ask where things stand.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_shop_offer=I want to help you open a flower shop in town.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.root.c_goodbye=That is all for now. I will see you later.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_quest_shop.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_quest_shop.body=My little plants deserve better than crates and cart wheels. I need a real flower shop with room to grow, display, and breathe. Take this token, stake the plot with your staff, and pay the materials listed on the sign. When it stands, meet me at the counter so we can close the order.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_quest_shop.c0=We will get your shop built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_quest_shop.c1=Not right now. I need a bit more time.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_shop_accepted.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_shop_accepted.body=Good. I will wait at the inn with my pots until the door is real. Stake the shop where sunlight can reach the cuttings, then meet me at the counter when the shelves are up.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_shop_accepted.c0=See you when the shelves are up.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_building.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_building.body=The seedlings are getting restless in their trays. Have you staked the plot and started the build yet, or should I stop counting on a shop that might not happen?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_building.c0=I need to drop the quest for now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_building.c1=I am still working on it and I will keep going.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_abandoned.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_abandoned.body=That is all right. The plants can wait a little longer in their pots. If you change your mind, come find me and we will try again.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_abandoned.c0=Fair enough. I will see you around.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_done.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_done.body=Oh, look at it. Warm light, honest shelves, and room for every cutting I brought on the road. My plants finally have a proper home in your town. Thank you for helping them grow here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_done.c0=Happy to help. Come find me if the town needs more green.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_offer.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_offer.body=The shop is for work. I would still love a little house with a sunny window for my potted friends and a shelf for tea when the day is done. Same house plot as everyone else, if you are willing.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_offer.c0=I will stake a house for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_offer.c1=Another time.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_accepted.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_accepted.body=When the walls are up, put my name on the block inside like the charter asks, then come tell me in person. I want to hear you say it before I start moving pots.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_accepted.c0=You will hear it from me.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_remind.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_remind.body=Take your time with the frame. When it is standing, register me on the shelf inside, then come back. I am not rushing you. I just want it written down.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_remind.c0=Understood.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_finish.speaker=Ivy Bloomwell
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_finish.body=Oh, this is lovely. Warm light, quiet walls, and just enough room for a few more pots on the sill. I can finally call some corner of your town mine.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.ivy_house_finish.c0=Glad you have a proper door.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.confirm=Would you like to give me something?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.love=Oh! This is perfect. You really know what a gardener loves.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.like=How sweet. Thank you for thinking of me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.neutral=Hmm. Not quite my taste, but thank you anyway.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.dislike=I would rather not keep that. Plants deserve better company.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.birthday.greeting=You came on my birthday. I may just pick you the brightest bloom.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_florist.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
